    "body": "@rotu Thanks. I took a look again a bit more in detail, and probably I caught your point. The step 3.11 _Run consume a required token given parser and \"end\"_ in [parse-a-pattern-string](https://urlpattern.spec.whatwg.org/#parse-a-pattern-string) will throw TypeError if `web+foo` is passed, because this algorithm doesn't handle `+`, which is treated as \"other-modifier\" [token type](https://urlpattern.spec.whatwg.org/#token-type) in the token list, and obviously this is not the \"end\" token type. ",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
